WEBVTT

01:40.020 --> 01:42.990
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.210 --> 01:45.840
[Episode 14]

01:48.200 --> 01:49.130
[Glorious Flowers in Spring and Solid Fruits in Autumn]

01:50.430 --> 01:51.360
Thank you.

01:54.390 --> 01:55.250
Thank you.

01:57.080 --> 01:57.830
Here we go.

02:02.550 --> 02:05.700
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

02:05.430 --> 02:06.340
Take care.

02:05.770 --> 02:09.039
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

02:06.510 --> 02:07.310
Take care.

02:10.030 --> 02:11.470
Thank you, Dr. Bai.

02:11.090 --> 02:14.090
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

02:11.750 --> 02:12.550
Be serious.

02:14.140 --> 02:17.560
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

02:19.120 --> 02:22.360
♫It's water under the bridge♫

02:22.430 --> 02:25.710
♫The moon sheds her light on my heart♫

02:27.710 --> 02:30.660
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

02:30.710 --> 02:34.320
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫

02:35.410 --> 02:38.760
♫The northern wind blows from beyond the mountains♫

02:38.880 --> 02:39.710
Tired?

02:39.660 --> 02:42.780
♫Along the icy river, it drifts into my dreams♫

02:40.550 --> 02:41.829
Take more of this medicine.

02:41.829 --> 02:42.890
Thank you, doctor.

02:43.910 --> 02:47.000
♫Drinking wine at the Tongque Terrace♫

02:46.750 --> 02:48.130
Have you all got your medicine?

02:48.130 --> 02:52.560
♫Even the stars feel close enough to touch♫

02:48.250 --> 02:49.710
Yes.

02:49.710 --> 02:50.670
Thank you, Dr. Bai.

02:50.670 --> 02:52.510
Thank you, Dr. Bai.

02:53.350 --> 02:54.360
No, no, no.

02:54.380 --> 02:55.510
Don't do this.

02:55.750 --> 02:56.590
Really.

02:56.590 --> 02:58.190
No, no, no.

03:07.300 --> 03:11.400
♫Life and death happen in an instant, but love and hate can endure for a long time♫

03:11.580 --> 03:15.400
♫Beyond cause and effect♫

03:15.710 --> 03:19.500
♫The heavens endure, the world remains eternal♫

03:19.860 --> 03:23.850
♫Rock and moss♫

03:24.579 --> 03:25.410
♫Are watching♫

03:25.700 --> 03:28.730
♫A lone boat drifts through the vast world, vanishing into mist♫

03:28.870 --> 03:32.280
♫Its sound fading away♫

03:32.960 --> 03:33.810
♫I wish♫

03:33.870 --> 03:36.950
♫The sorrow of parting stayed beyond the river, and that we did not share the same mountain and moon♫

03:37.070 --> 03:40.870
♫Deep love, yet fate runs shallow♫

03:41.200 --> 03:46.510
[To Zhuo Yichen]

04:11.480 --> 04:13.280
Zhu Yan, you brat!

04:13.430 --> 04:15.150
You haven't learned to control malicious energy yet,

04:15.150 --> 04:16.680
but you left the mountain secretly.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.750
I've already learned it.

04:17.750 --> 04:18.980
You haven't!

05:09.950 --> 05:11.520
Life is short,

05:11.630 --> 05:13.190
but it's like fireworks.

05:14.780 --> 05:15.550
Gorgeous

05:15.910 --> 05:16.750
and grand.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.510
In the next life,

05:21.990 --> 05:23.470
I don't want to be a demon.

05:28.190 --> 05:30.000
I want to be an ordinary person.

05:31.670 --> 05:32.370
Fei.

05:33.550 --> 05:35.480
May you be human in your next life,

05:37.390 --> 05:39.220
born to an ordinary family

05:40.440 --> 05:43.170
so that you won't suffer like you did in this life.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.920
I hope you can witness

05:47.360 --> 05:49.800
the peace and prosperity in this world.

05:49.240 --> 05:53.290
♫You left a candle and went somewhere far away♫

05:53.430 --> 05:57.870
♫I wipe away my sadness and try not to think about you♫

05:58.090 --> 05:59.750
♫But your face in my dream♫

05:59.810 --> 06:00.730
♫Is unforgettable♫

06:00.820 --> 06:04.350
♫Who will heat up the wine♫

06:04.030 --> 06:06.900
There are countless rules in this world.

06:04.990 --> 06:06.820
♫And drink with me?♫

06:08.250 --> 06:10.080
But none can beat one's willingness to do something.

06:08.310 --> 06:13.130
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

06:13.390 --> 06:17.120
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

06:17.500 --> 06:22.430
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

06:22.530 --> 06:26.350
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

06:23.440 --> 06:24.640
I'm not leaving.

06:26.550 --> 06:28.290
I will stay here.

06:26.750 --> 06:31.400
♫Those who understand the song will be moved to tears♫

06:29.820 --> 06:31.590
As long as I'm still here,

06:31.610 --> 06:35.220
♫Hold our hands tightly but don't say anything♫

06:33.409 --> 06:35.130
this world

06:35.680 --> 06:38.310
♫Watch the fate of the world♫

06:36.430 --> 06:38.390
will never forget you.

06:38.540 --> 06:43.390
♫The candle in the wind♫

06:44.020 --> 06:47.190
♫It remembers the past♫

06:48.170 --> 06:50.150
♫We shared♫

07:07.750 --> 07:12.580
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

07:12.770 --> 07:16.660
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

07:16.840 --> 07:19.550
♫Watch the fate of the world♫

07:19.900 --> 07:24.550
♫The candle in the wind♫

07:25.060 --> 07:28.350
♫It remembers the past♫

07:28.620 --> 07:29.910
I've made my decision.

07:31.930 --> 07:33.820
♫We shared♫

07:41.650 --> 07:43.380
If your heart is like a stone,

07:43.520 --> 07:45.350
a century is only a moment.

07:49.770 --> 07:51.570
The blue bird is born with wings,

07:52.140 --> 07:54.340
but it is willing to be trapped in a cage.

07:56.350 --> 07:58.150
Even if it has wings in its heart,

07:58.470 --> 08:00.870
it can only imprison itself in a fixed spot.

08:05.400 --> 08:09.300
♫The little city traps♫

08:09.330 --> 08:11.430
♫The little us♫

08:11.500 --> 08:14.680
♫Going around and around♫

08:14.980 --> 08:16.380
♫Dusk and dawn♫

08:16.350 --> 08:17.830
Bai Jiu likes fireworks.

08:17.620 --> 08:19.750
♫The heavy door♫

08:19.030 --> 08:20.600
He should be very happy now.

08:20.110 --> 08:23.660
♫Who is waiting foolishly♫

08:21.470 --> 08:22.270
Yeah.

08:23.830 --> 08:28.880
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

08:24.430 --> 08:25.510
You like it too?

08:28.160 --> 08:28.670
Yes.

08:30.100 --> 08:32.159
♫The pillow of the past♫

08:30.110 --> 08:32.110
Isn't the scenery of the Wilderness

08:32.470 --> 08:35.950
♫Still has the warmth of the dream♫

08:32.909 --> 08:34.750
much better than these gimmicks

08:34.750 --> 08:35.880
in the mortal world?

08:36.169 --> 08:38.250
♫The dust from yesterday♫

08:37.270 --> 08:38.870
No matter how vast the scenery in the Wilderness is,

08:38.570 --> 08:41.330
♫Covering my eyes♫

08:39.830 --> 08:41.960
it's the creation of heaven and earth.

08:41.990 --> 08:43.789
It has nothing to do with us demons.

08:42.250 --> 08:44.400
♫The person in the dream♫

08:44.640 --> 08:48.290
♫Is silent, waiting with each step♫

08:45.910 --> 08:47.230
As a great demon,

08:47.910 --> 08:49.350
can you use magic

08:48.590 --> 08:51.940
♫Refuses to leave, and refuses♫

08:49.670 --> 08:51.930
to create an even bigger fireworks show?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.460
♫To turn around♫

08:59.050 --> 09:01.590
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

09:01.630 --> 09:04.240
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

09:04.550 --> 09:09.650
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

09:10.890 --> 09:12.850
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

09:12.920 --> 09:15.540
♫Someone is longing for♫

09:15.640 --> 09:17.120
♫Softly calling for♫

09:17.150 --> 09:21.170
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

09:21.230 --> 09:24.020
♫The world echoes with a single sigh♫

09:22.550 --> 09:24.130
Do you know that this sort of sparkle

09:24.130 --> 09:26.540
♫Love and hate each fills half the heart♫

09:24.710 --> 09:25.910
is cold?

09:26.500 --> 09:27.310
It's cold?

09:26.870 --> 09:31.840
♫The years are filled with grudges and grace♫

09:30.650 --> 09:31.940
It looks dangerous,

09:32.870 --> 09:34.360
but it doesn't burn.

09:32.990 --> 09:35.150
♫The cry of summer cicadas♫

09:35.230 --> 09:37.790
♫The slumber of winter snow♫

09:38.020 --> 09:43.450
♫No idle wishes and no hopeless longing for eternity♫

09:46.640 --> 09:48.000
The fireworks are so beautiful.

09:48.000 --> 09:49.970
It's a pity that Brother Zhuo missed out on it.

09:49.970 --> 09:50.750
I prescribed medicine all day

09:50.750 --> 09:51.550
and didn't eat.

09:51.550 --> 09:52.590
I'm starving.

09:52.870 --> 09:53.230
Jiu.

09:53.230 --> 09:54.050
Let's go to Mount Kunlun tomorrow.

09:54.050 --> 09:55.190
I'll catch a rabbit for you.

09:55.190 --> 09:55.520
Here.

09:55.590 --> 09:56.660
Keep your promise.

09:56.660 --> 09:58.580
If you don't, you'll have to swallow a needle.

09:58.580 --> 09:59.640
Of course.

10:00.100 --> 10:01.270
We have food and drinks.

10:01.270 --> 10:02.270
Help yourselves.

10:05.950 --> 10:06.550
Wen Xiao.

10:32.670 --> 10:34.320
The plague is finally over.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.160
Tonight

10:35.780 --> 10:37.170
is worth celebrating.

10:37.910 --> 10:39.590
The bright moon, the autumn breeze,

10:39.590 --> 10:40.990
the bugs' chirping, and the night dew.

10:40.990 --> 10:42.520
We can drink to all of those.

10:42.910 --> 10:43.830
It seems

10:44.390 --> 10:46.200
we're missing a song and dance.

10:46.950 --> 10:48.350
Even if you offer to sing,

10:49.080 --> 10:50.610
no one would dare to listen.

10:57.670 --> 10:59.070
Why are you looking at me?

10:59.670 --> 11:02.180
I heard that you're great at sword dancing,

11:02.200 --> 11:03.400
Mr. Zhuo.

11:03.640 --> 11:05.240
Why don't you perform for us?

11:06.160 --> 11:07.020
Perform for us.

11:08.350 --> 11:09.060
This...

11:10.830 --> 11:11.630
Brother Zhuo.

11:11.670 --> 11:12.630
Perform for us.

11:12.790 --> 11:13.470
Mr. Zhuo.

11:13.470 --> 11:14.110
Perform for us.

11:14.110 --> 11:14.970
Perform for us.

11:15.110 --> 11:16.640
Brother Zhuo, dance for us.

11:16.960 --> 11:17.940
Okay...

11:18.710 --> 11:19.350
Hey.

11:19.570 --> 11:21.100
I think we should forget it.

11:21.470 --> 11:23.970
Mr. Zhuo is normally a no-nonsense person.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.400
It's too much

11:25.430 --> 11:27.320
to ask him to perform for us.

11:38.500 --> 11:39.440
Here it comes.

11:39.460 --> 11:41.060
I can perform sword dancing.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.410
Zhao Yuanzhou.

11:42.540 --> 11:44.020
You're not young anymore.

11:44.120 --> 11:46.100
You should get up and exercise.

11:46.450 --> 11:47.510
Join me.

11:46.620 --> 11:50.120
♫There are countless rules in this world♫

11:50.290 --> 11:52.500
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

11:52.730 --> 11:58.610
♫If heaven decides my destiny, I'll be its enemy♫

11:58.670 --> 12:02.160
♫I sing under the moon and swing my sword to the wind♫

12:02.220 --> 12:04.390
♫Drunk on the autumn breeze beneath the bright moon♫

12:04.660 --> 12:10.130
♫Penning small verses of a grand legend♫

12:10.770 --> 12:14.060
♫You say there are countless rules in this world♫

12:14.310 --> 12:16.380
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

12:16.700 --> 12:22.100
♫I say if fate is determined by Heaven, I'll defy Heaven♫

12:22.690 --> 12:26.110
♫Wealth and fame turn to dust and drift away♫

12:26.340 --> 12:28.540
♫Love and hate are best left unspoken♫

12:28.740 --> 12:34.230
♫Better to have a dream before parting ways♫

12:35.520 --> 12:36.760
♫In this bustling world♫

12:36.930 --> 12:38.120
♫Scattered traces remain♫

12:38.430 --> 12:41.040
♫The riddle of time♫

12:41.390 --> 12:42.790
♫The joy and sorrow of life♫

12:42.970 --> 12:44.110
♫A few hasty lines♫

12:44.400 --> 12:47.130
♫Addressing love and hate♫

12:47.490 --> 12:48.560
♫Sometimes I avoid things♫

12:48.850 --> 12:50.080
♫Sometimes I hesitate♫

12:50.390 --> 12:53.120
♫But I never speak of giving up♫

12:53.440 --> 12:54.470
♫Our tacit understanding♫

12:54.830 --> 12:56.020
♫Travels through memories♫

12:56.430 --> 12:58.580
♫Across the silent distance♫

12:58.630 --> 13:01.970
♫There are countless rules in this world♫

13:02.120 --> 13:04.360
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

13:04.490 --> 13:10.390
♫If heaven decides my destiny, I'll be its enemy♫

13:10.560 --> 13:14.030
♫I sing under the moon and swing my sword to the wind♫

13:14.160 --> 13:16.200
♫Drunk on the autumn breeze beneath the bright moon♫

13:16.720 --> 13:22.180
♫Penning small verses of a grand legend♫

13:35.330 --> 13:36.580
♫In this bustling world♫

13:36.880 --> 13:37.990
♫Scattered traces remain♫

13:38.270 --> 13:41.120
♫The riddle of time♫

13:41.380 --> 13:42.680
♫The joy and sorrow of life♫

13:42.930 --> 13:44.050
♫A few hasty lines♫

13:44.440 --> 13:47.040
♫Addressing love and hate♫

13:47.390 --> 13:48.540
♫I wish to become the wind♫

13:48.900 --> 13:50.010
♫And transform into rain♫

13:50.350 --> 13:53.210
♫To accompany you for thousands of miles♫

13:53.290 --> 13:54.370
♫From the south to the north♫

13:54.700 --> 13:55.780
♫From the east to the west♫

13:56.250 --> 13:58.580
♫Fireworks adorn the scene♫

13:58.470 --> 13:59.420
Zhuo Yichen!

13:58.620 --> 14:02.010
♫You say there are countless rules in this world♫

13:59.720 --> 14:00.510
Zhao Yuanzhou!

14:00.510 --> 14:01.310
Zhuo Yichen!

14:01.310 --> 14:02.110
Zhao Yuanzhou!

14:02.110 --> 14:02.910
Zhuo Yichen!

14:02.160 --> 14:04.430
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

14:02.910 --> 14:03.720
Zhao Yuanzhou!

14:03.720 --> 14:04.510
Zhuo Yichen!

14:04.570 --> 14:10.030
♫I say if fate is determined by Heaven, I'll defy Heaven♫

14:04.670 --> 14:05.530
Zhao Yuanzhou!

14:05.710 --> 14:06.510
Zhuo Yichen!

14:06.510 --> 14:07.370
Zhao Yuanzhou!

14:07.470 --> 14:08.270
Zhuo Yichen!

14:10.560 --> 14:14.010
♫Wealth and fame turn to dust and drift away♫

14:14.260 --> 14:16.270
♫Love and hate are best left unspoken♫

14:16.600 --> 14:22.190
♫Better to have a dream before parting ways♫

15:10.480 --> 15:11.500
Sister.

15:16.350 --> 15:17.810
I'm not in danger.

15:18.150 --> 15:19.480
Why are you here?

15:19.950 --> 15:21.550
I'm just here to sit with you.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.870
I'll pass.

15:34.640 --> 15:35.680
Alright.

15:36.430 --> 15:37.350
I'll eat it.

16:12.990 --> 16:14.920
Spider, oh spider.

16:14.950 --> 16:17.190
White Ape, oh white ape.

16:17.220 --> 16:19.110
Zhao Yuanzhou, oh Zhao Yuanzhou.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.130
Jiu.

16:22.980 --> 16:24.130
Why are you still up?

16:25.060 --> 16:27.190
We're leaving early tomorrow morning.

16:27.190 --> 16:27.910
And you.

16:27.930 --> 16:28.790
Zhao Yuanzhou.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.300
You're not young anymore.

16:31.350 --> 16:33.750
Why are you still fooling around with them?

16:40.890 --> 16:42.610
Since you're here,

16:42.630 --> 16:44.620
why don't we play a game?

16:45.140 --> 16:46.060
Sure.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.700
In Yao's time, there was such a plant.

16:51.700 --> 16:53.430
It grew on the courtyard steps.

16:53.510 --> 16:55.630
When an ill-meaning liar entered the court,

16:55.630 --> 16:57.630
the leaves would bend to identify them.

16:57.630 --> 16:59.760
It's called the Lie-detecting Plant.

17:00.750 --> 17:01.590
This plant

17:01.590 --> 17:02.960
can discern people's hearts

17:02.960 --> 17:04.440
and see through lies.

17:04.589 --> 17:06.680
If it hears a liar,

17:07.109 --> 17:08.710
its leaves will bend

17:09.310 --> 17:10.369
and appear wilted.

17:11.880 --> 17:14.690
Whoever my flute points to later

17:15.329 --> 17:17.220
will answer a question from me.

17:18.589 --> 17:20.160
Let's get started.

17:20.430 --> 17:21.230
Okay.

17:42.670 --> 17:43.880
Just ask.

17:45.750 --> 17:46.630
Pei.

17:47.590 --> 17:48.390
Are you

17:49.050 --> 17:50.840
a spy from Chongwu Camp?

18:02.630 --> 18:03.900
What's going on?

18:05.490 --> 18:06.620
What do you mean?

18:07.490 --> 18:10.150
[To Zhuo Yichen]

18:07.920 --> 18:09.950
We received a letter from Mr. Situ.

18:11.150 --> 18:12.320
According to the letter,

18:12.320 --> 18:14.840
someone tipped Chongwu Camp off.

18:15.180 --> 18:16.320
In other words,

18:16.430 --> 18:17.870
one of us

18:17.980 --> 18:20.060
is a spy from Chongwu Camp.

18:25.190 --> 18:26.110
Chongwu Camp

18:26.110 --> 18:28.750
has been very informed about our movements.

18:29.630 --> 18:32.230
That's why we keep getting blocked in our path.

18:32.230 --> 18:34.430
Only a few people knew that we were going

18:34.710 --> 18:35.510
to Kunlun.

18:36.790 --> 18:38.940
Yet Chongwu Camp knew about it in advance

18:38.940 --> 18:41.670
and made use of Qing Geng to deploy an ambush here.

18:43.950 --> 18:46.010
With the power of the Shanhai Portal,

18:46.350 --> 18:48.950
we should have directly reached Mount Kunlun.

18:49.900 --> 18:51.650
So who affected Ying Lei

18:51.680 --> 18:53.000
and caused his mistake

18:53.500 --> 18:55.560
which brought us to Sinan Water Town?

18:58.990 --> 19:00.010
I'm sorry.

19:00.380 --> 19:02.350
When I was thinking about Mount Kunlun just now,

19:02.350 --> 19:04.120
I suddenly remembered Ms. Pei mention the

19:04.120 --> 19:06.430
Sinan Water Town at the foot of Mount Kunlun,

19:06.430 --> 19:08.960
which is lively during the Lantern Festival.

19:10.080 --> 19:11.980
Who separated us

19:12.640 --> 19:13.560
and let Zhuo

19:13.580 --> 19:15.220
investigate first?

19:15.250 --> 19:16.010
Wait.

19:16.470 --> 19:17.350
Wait for what?

19:17.380 --> 19:18.480
For Jiu to be eaten by the demon?

19:18.480 --> 19:20.100
Don't you think it's strange?

19:20.100 --> 19:21.500
It's obvious that the demon took Jiu

19:21.500 --> 19:23.220
to lure us over.

19:24.300 --> 19:26.750
Mr. Zhuo and Zhao Yuanzhou have gone into the fog.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.110
They're so capable,

19:28.110 --> 19:29.770
they can definitely save Jiu.

19:30.540 --> 19:32.800
We'll only cause trouble if we join them.

19:32.830 --> 19:34.070
Let's wait here

19:34.090 --> 19:35.290
and see what happens.

19:42.710 --> 19:43.550
Pei.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.120
Are you

19:46.990 --> 19:49.340
a spy from Chongwu Camp?

19:51.910 --> 19:53.110
No.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.270
Ms. Pei.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.330
You lied.

20:27.740 --> 20:29.500
It's so scary, Sister Pei.

20:29.790 --> 20:30.610
You...

20:31.280 --> 20:32.340
Stay away from her.

20:53.270 --> 20:54.950
Is this your so-called

20:55.590 --> 20:56.400
evidence?

21:02.790 --> 21:03.960
I knew it.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.590
In this world,

21:05.790 --> 21:08.030
there's nothing that can discern the human heart.

21:08.030 --> 21:09.590
The reason it bent was because

21:09.590 --> 21:11.560
dew gathered on the grass.

21:11.590 --> 21:12.550
Mr. Zhuo

21:12.550 --> 21:15.530
used the water-freezing method I taught him

21:16.030 --> 21:18.030
to control the bending of the grass.

21:26.530 --> 21:28.550
How could you, Mr. Zhuo?

21:28.900 --> 21:30.310
I taught you skills,

21:30.380 --> 21:32.910
but you used them to fool people with Wen Xiao.

21:40.670 --> 21:42.250
You wanted to test me?

21:44.510 --> 21:45.310
Yes.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.490
After all, among the six of us,

21:48.790 --> 21:50.650
you were the most suspicious one.

22:00.940 --> 22:02.290
People from the Chongwu Camp

22:02.290 --> 22:03.790
all have a special

22:04.020 --> 22:06.580
cloud tattoo on their wrists

22:06.720 --> 22:08.380
to represent their identity.

22:09.070 --> 22:11.530
I was once the commander of the Chongwu Camp.

22:11.650 --> 22:13.100
It's not a secret.

22:15.260 --> 22:17.400
But I've long left on my own accord.

22:18.060 --> 22:20.860
I have nothing to do with the Chongwu Camp anymore.

22:21.470 --> 22:22.500
Besides,

22:22.630 --> 22:24.670
it was you who convinced me

22:26.110 --> 22:27.170
to join your group.

22:30.580 --> 22:33.300
Besides, I also caught the plague in Lingxi Villa.

22:33.300 --> 22:34.950
I could have died too.

22:35.130 --> 22:37.350
If I were a spy from the Chongwu Camp,

22:38.630 --> 22:40.490
I wouldn't have taken such a risk.

22:44.630 --> 22:46.490
I think what she said makes sense.

22:52.400 --> 22:54.490
Since there is a spy among us,

22:55.110 --> 22:56.870
why can't it be you?

23:00.270 --> 23:02.200
Sister Pei, you sure hold a grudge.

23:04.520 --> 23:07.210
I wanted to join the Chongwu Camp.

23:07.590 --> 23:09.670
I heard they know demons very well.

23:09.690 --> 23:11.950
They have a lot of valuable information.

23:12.270 --> 23:14.930
Unfortunately, my father didn't allow me to go.

23:15.410 --> 23:18.010
You're not usually that obedient towards him.

23:21.110 --> 23:22.780
Every generation of Baize Goddess

23:22.780 --> 23:24.080
is good to demons.

23:24.120 --> 23:25.520
It's definitely not her.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.920
She treats demons well.

23:30.220 --> 23:31.750
But she treats great demons

23:32.260 --> 23:33.040
not so well.

23:44.260 --> 23:45.830
Why are you all looking at me?

23:45.830 --> 23:47.460
How could I be a spy?

23:48.430 --> 23:49.470
It's hard to say.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.700
That's right.

23:51.270 --> 23:52.680
If I were a spy,

23:53.070 --> 23:54.350
why would I come to the Demon Hunting Bureau

23:54.350 --> 23:56.010
to help you complete the task?

23:56.090 --> 23:58.530
I worked so hard and did so much.

23:58.990 --> 24:00.350
A trick to gain our sympathy.

24:00.350 --> 24:01.150
Yes.

24:01.360 --> 24:02.820
You love acting anyway.

24:04.550 --> 24:05.930
I'm a demon.

24:05.960 --> 24:08.310
The Chongwu Camp specializes in killing demons.

24:08.310 --> 24:10.680
Besides, they're eyeing my inner core.

24:11.020 --> 24:12.110
Zhuo Yichen,

24:12.510 --> 24:14.440
please look clearly with your dog-

24:16.150 --> 24:17.620
Look carefully.

24:18.630 --> 24:19.510
But I remember

24:19.510 --> 24:20.970
someone threatened Mr. Situ

24:20.970 --> 24:22.810
in the Demon Hunting Bureau

24:22.870 --> 24:24.650
and said if we didn't collaborate with you,

24:24.650 --> 24:26.450
you would go to the Chongwu Camp.

24:26.590 --> 24:27.750
I was angry.

24:27.790 --> 24:29.330
I said it out of anger.

24:29.510 --> 24:32.570
Do you humans believe words said out of anger that much?

24:33.470 --> 24:35.200
What's there to be angry about?

24:35.470 --> 24:39.130
I was angry because a woman didn't appreciate my true love for her.

24:42.270 --> 24:43.670
There's no greater agony

24:44.760 --> 24:47.160
than giving your heart to the wrong person.

24:54.430 --> 24:55.820
Who's next?

24:56.540 --> 24:57.200
Him.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.040
Huh?

25:08.790 --> 25:10.030
Me?

25:10.620 --> 25:12.410
I'm a cook.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.570
A cook is also suitable for being a spy.

25:14.840 --> 25:16.520
Before I met you,

25:16.640 --> 25:18.590
I didn't even know what the Demon Hunting Bureau

25:18.590 --> 25:19.500
or the Chongwu Camp do.

25:19.500 --> 25:20.450
Besides,

25:20.710 --> 25:22.790
you couldn't have gone back

25:22.810 --> 25:23.880
without my Shanhai Portal.

25:23.880 --> 25:25.280
You would have been dead.

25:25.320 --> 25:26.130
You're right.

25:26.310 --> 25:27.110
Yeah.

25:27.690 --> 25:28.430
I guess Little Mountain God

25:28.430 --> 25:31.070
is better at memorizing recipes than intelligence.

25:31.070 --> 25:32.550
He doesn't meet the Chongwu Camp's standards.

25:32.550 --> 25:33.200
Yeah.

25:34.640 --> 25:36.380
There's no greater agony

25:36.670 --> 25:39.070
than giving your heart to the wrong person.

25:41.850 --> 25:43.640
Speaking of the mountain god temple,

25:43.640 --> 25:45.630
when we went back to the Demon Hunting Bureau that day,

25:45.630 --> 25:47.180
whose appearance

25:47.620 --> 25:49.680
made us enter the mountain god temple

25:50.230 --> 25:52.960
and almost fall into the trap of the Chongwu Camp?

25:55.070 --> 25:56.430
I'm just a doctor.

25:56.790 --> 25:58.560
And I went there to welcome you.

25:59.000 --> 25:59.800
I'm innocent.

26:00.030 --> 26:01.310
There are also doctors in the Chongwu Camp.

26:01.310 --> 26:02.470
I don't know martial arts.

26:02.470 --> 26:03.990
But you can make up prescriptions,

26:03.990 --> 26:05.120
sprinkle medicine,

26:05.430 --> 26:06.880
and do acupuncture.

26:07.310 --> 26:09.040
You're not an ordinary doctor.

26:10.750 --> 26:12.130
I'm timid and afraid of death.

26:12.130 --> 26:12.790
I have hemophobia

26:12.790 --> 26:13.790
and I'm cowardly.

26:13.950 --> 26:16.230
I studied medicine because my mother is seriously ill.

26:16.230 --> 26:17.630
I want to cure my mother.

26:22.150 --> 26:23.480
Your mother's illness?

26:26.730 --> 26:29.130
If your wish is to cure your mother,

26:30.110 --> 26:32.400
the Chongwu Camp has been hunting demons for years.

26:32.400 --> 26:34.330
It has collected many rare herbs

26:34.350 --> 26:35.550
and treasures.

26:36.750 --> 26:39.270
Maybe some of them can help you

26:40.110 --> 26:41.310
fulfill your wish.

26:44.030 --> 26:45.310
Say no more.

26:45.990 --> 26:47.200
The Chongwu Camp's members

26:47.200 --> 26:49.410
have a cloud tattoo on their wrists.

26:49.760 --> 26:51.820
We'll know after we check our wrists.

26:55.370 --> 26:56.420
Hurry up.

26:58.350 --> 26:59.610
I'm going to air it out.

27:01.080 --> 27:02.480
Just a small patch is wet.

27:02.550 --> 27:03.840
Why bother?

27:04.990 --> 27:06.280
Air it out first.

27:08.370 --> 27:09.170
Come on, Jiu.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.330
Brother Zhuo.

27:25.350 --> 27:26.540
Bai Jiu,

27:27.310 --> 27:29.290
we need to check your wrist.

27:41.750 --> 27:43.780
Actually, Mr. Situ gave us a hint

27:44.350 --> 27:45.580
in the letter.

27:47.310 --> 27:48.900
He said

27:49.930 --> 27:51.850
it's most likely that the spy

27:52.930 --> 27:54.140
is Bai Jiu.

27:55.660 --> 27:56.910
I'm not a spy.

27:57.440 --> 27:58.970
Brother Zhuo, trust me.

27:59.260 --> 28:00.730
I really am not.

28:05.380 --> 28:06.860
Then show us your wrist

28:07.660 --> 28:08.890
and we'll know.

28:13.670 --> 28:14.870
E-Even if there is a cloud tattoo on his wrist,

28:14.870 --> 28:16.550
it... it doesn't mean he is

28:16.620 --> 28:17.720
a spy from the Chongwu Camp.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.660
Is there any other possibility?

28:18.660 --> 28:19.750
So,

28:21.300 --> 28:23.300
you saw it on Bai Jiu's wrist?

28:24.960 --> 28:26.020
No.

28:27.350 --> 28:29.110
I was just asking.

28:29.990 --> 28:30.790
Ying Lei,

28:31.790 --> 28:33.230
you're so bad at lying.

28:33.230 --> 28:33.910
Well,

28:34.060 --> 28:35.680
how could Jiu be a spy?

28:35.910 --> 28:36.770
Think about it.

28:36.810 --> 28:38.410
He has been treating us.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.610
Without him,

28:39.670 --> 28:41.000
we would have been dead!

28:41.060 --> 28:42.120
-Ying Lei!
-And...

28:42.940 --> 28:43.920
Stop talking.

28:44.280 --> 28:46.280
Your trust in me alone is pointless.

28:49.570 --> 28:50.850
Just show us

28:51.940 --> 28:53.130
if there is one.

28:56.210 --> 28:58.060
So is there a cloud tattoo or not?

29:47.550 --> 29:48.430
Brother Zhuo.

29:52.840 --> 29:54.420
Do you believe me now?

30:02.580 --> 30:03.380
Bai Jiu!

30:29.270 --> 30:34.510
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

30:33.070 --> 30:33.910
Jiu,

30:34.560 --> 30:35.720
have you gone to bed?

30:34.700 --> 30:39.840
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

30:41.550 --> 30:46.810
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

30:46.980 --> 30:52.230
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

30:48.550 --> 30:49.350
Little Bunny,

30:50.430 --> 30:51.690
we were too arbitrary.

30:51.880 --> 30:53.010
We apologize to you.

30:53.150 --> 30:56.130
♫The bell jingles and sways♫

30:56.240 --> 30:59.060
♫Thoughts circle back and forth♫

30:59.600 --> 31:04.790
♫Who can truly understand the essence of growing up?♫

31:02.830 --> 31:03.640
Jiu,

31:04.300 --> 31:06.350
I'll give you all the meat next time.

31:05.460 --> 31:08.700
♫Life is grand♫

31:07.030 --> 31:07.890
Don't be angry.

31:09.370 --> 31:11.690
♫Yet so small♫

31:12.240 --> 31:16.930
♫I hope everything is fine♫

31:45.330 --> 31:51.100
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

31:51.350 --> 31:56.550
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

31:59.080 --> 32:05.000
♫Its cry has never been heard♫

32:05.320 --> 32:11.640
♫Only I know its story♫

32:25.800 --> 32:28.570
The matter about the Chongwu Camp's spy still needs to be verified.

32:28.570 --> 32:30.150
Why did you tell them?

32:32.320 --> 32:34.450
You know my relationship with Bai Jiu.

32:34.750 --> 32:37.210
I really don't want him to go to Mount Kunlun.

32:37.630 --> 32:39.070
If I stop him from going there,

32:39.070 --> 32:40.670
he will definitely disobey.

32:40.680 --> 32:42.530
That's why I did that.

32:44.110 --> 32:45.270
You really...

32:45.290 --> 32:46.050
My Lord,

32:46.080 --> 32:47.060
our scout found

32:47.130 --> 32:48.840
Commander Zhen has secretly led

32:48.840 --> 32:50.550
a secret elite troop of the Chongwu Camp

32:50.550 --> 32:52.430
to Mount Kunlun.

33:34.280 --> 33:35.080
Jiu.

33:44.830 --> 33:45.780
Did you sleep well,

33:45.780 --> 33:46.820
Little Bunny?

33:46.980 --> 33:47.610
Jiu.

33:49.830 --> 33:52.290
The shopkeeper even gave us a chicken?

33:55.910 --> 33:57.220
I stole it.

33:57.560 --> 33:59.410
Jiu, come and eat.

33:59.440 --> 34:01.170
We should set out after eating.

34:28.030 --> 34:30.100
Looks like the one Little Bunny cares most about

34:30.100 --> 34:32.989
is the great hero in his heart: Mr. Zhuo.

34:33.150 --> 34:34.370
You pissed him off.

34:34.400 --> 34:36.340
Are you sure you're not going to coax him?

34:36.340 --> 34:38.239
We all pissed him off, right?

34:38.429 --> 34:40.040
How come it's my fault?

34:41.880 --> 34:44.520
But he obviously hates you the most now.

34:46.110 --> 34:47.320
Zhao Yuanzhou,

34:47.670 --> 34:49.350
are you very happy now

34:49.389 --> 34:52.320
because finally, someone is more annoying than you?

34:53.860 --> 34:55.880
He's good at fighting and hunting demons.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.590
But coaxing kids

34:57.750 --> 34:59.710
is too difficult for Mr. Zhuo.

35:00.830 --> 35:01.940
It's very easy

35:02.010 --> 35:03.260
to coax kids.

35:05.140 --> 35:06.400
It's very easy.

35:06.590 --> 35:07.670
Give him a candy

35:07.830 --> 35:09.280
and pat him on his head.

35:18.700 --> 35:19.910
Candy?

35:56.620 --> 35:58.920
Dear friends and relatives,

35:59.240 --> 36:01.180
please open your eyes.

36:01.250 --> 36:02.130
What's ahead is

36:02.710 --> 36:04.790
the Kunlun mountain god temple.

36:12.840 --> 36:13.640
Let's go.

36:21.560 --> 36:22.780
♫In this bustling world♫

36:23.280 --> 36:24.220
♫Scattered traces remain♫

36:24.480 --> 36:27.180
♫The riddle of time♫

36:27.550 --> 36:28.940
♫The joy and sorrow of life♫

36:29.050 --> 36:30.260
♫A few hasty lines♫

36:30.550 --> 36:33.060
♫Addressing love and hate♫

36:33.580 --> 36:34.730
♫I wish to become the wind♫

36:35.100 --> 36:36.210
♫And transform into rain♫

36:36.560 --> 36:39.260
♫To accompany you for thousands of miles♫

36:39.470 --> 36:40.640
♫From the south to the north♫

36:41.020 --> 36:42.080
♫From the east to the west♫

36:42.670 --> 36:44.860
♫Fireworks adorn the scene♫

36:44.940 --> 36:48.290
♫You say there are countless rules in this world♫

36:48.370 --> 36:50.690
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

36:50.810 --> 36:56.280
♫I say if fate is determined by Heaven, I'll defy Heaven♫

36:53.250 --> 36:53.890
Grandpa!

36:53.970 --> 36:54.770
I'm back!

36:56.840 --> 37:00.160
♫Wealth and fame turn to dust and drift away♫

37:00.460 --> 37:02.500
♫Love and hate are best left unspoken♫

37:01.120 --> 37:01.750
Grandpa.

37:02.010 --> 37:03.010
Let go.

37:02.720 --> 37:08.420
♫Better to have a dream before parting ways♫

37:03.550 --> 37:05.710
Stop shaking me.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.860
Ying Lei, you're back.

37:09.270 --> 37:10.110
What?

37:10.560 --> 37:13.540
Don't you want to pursue your great dream in the mortal world?

37:13.540 --> 37:15.150
I still want to pursue it.

37:15.830 --> 37:16.470
But we

37:16.490 --> 37:17.830
have found the Baize Token.

37:17.830 --> 37:18.670
The priority

37:18.710 --> 37:19.700
is to come back

37:19.720 --> 37:21.130
to save the Wilderness.

37:24.910 --> 37:25.640
Goddess,

37:27.040 --> 37:28.690
this is my grandpa, Ying Zhao.

37:28.690 --> 37:30.490
That man is Mountain God Zhu Yin.

37:31.490 --> 37:33.260
Goddess, greetings.

37:35.920 --> 37:38.570
Ms. Wen Xiao, thank you for bringing back the Baize Divine Power.

37:38.570 --> 37:40.000
Mountain Gods in the Wilderness

37:40.000 --> 37:41.330
will be at your command.

37:43.920 --> 37:44.790
Mr. Zhu Yin,

37:45.240 --> 37:47.160
I just retrieved the Baize Token.

37:47.770 --> 37:49.130
I don't know

37:50.000 --> 37:51.600
if I can save the Wilderness.

37:51.830 --> 37:53.550
I still need your guidance.

37:54.580 --> 37:55.830
You brat!

37:57.800 --> 37:59.590
You actually came back.

38:00.240 --> 38:01.570
Brat!

38:03.750 --> 38:04.630
Take this.

38:04.870 --> 38:07.020
I'll hit back if you hit me again.

38:08.000 --> 38:08.840
Hit back!

38:08.990 --> 38:09.710
Hit back!

38:09.900 --> 38:10.830
I told you to stop!

38:10.830 --> 38:11.830
Take this. You...

38:12.990 --> 38:13.350
Freeze!

38:13.350 --> 38:15.440
-Cut it out!
-Stop!

38:15.440 --> 38:16.590
Stop!

38:17.750 --> 38:19.450
A master is beating his dog.

38:19.690 --> 38:20.780
He's taming a monkey.

38:20.780 --> 38:22.440
I helped you clear up the mess.

38:22.570 --> 38:24.640
Have you forgotten the rules

38:24.740 --> 38:26.760
and moral characters I told you?

38:28.050 --> 38:28.760
Grandpa Ying Zhao.

38:28.760 --> 38:29.560
Take this!

38:35.620 --> 38:37.650
You are the legendary Torch Dragon?

38:37.810 --> 38:39.300
Goddess, you know me?

38:40.040 --> 38:41.020
Legend has it that

38:41.020 --> 38:43.220
you're the most mysterious Dragon God.

38:43.450 --> 38:46.580
You can illuminate the darkest part of the netherworld.

39:10.130 --> 39:11.690
Zhu Yin and I

39:11.720 --> 39:13.740
have guarded the gate for years.

39:16.680 --> 39:17.960
Now,

39:17.990 --> 39:20.190
Mount Kunlun is about to collapse.

39:20.430 --> 39:21.430
The Wilderness

39:21.570 --> 39:22.920
is at stake.

39:26.990 --> 39:28.720
The 28 constellations

39:28.950 --> 39:30.800
have vanished.

39:31.310 --> 39:33.660
There is nothing we can do.

39:34.810 --> 39:36.630
But now that Goddess is back,

39:36.950 --> 39:39.030
we just need to activate the Star Formation

39:39.030 --> 39:40.390
and inject the Baize Divine Power.

39:40.390 --> 39:42.190
Then we can save the Wilderness.

39:42.390 --> 39:44.250
There's something very strange.

39:45.230 --> 39:46.290
Grandpa Ying Zhao,

39:46.630 --> 39:47.830
you've lived for many years.

39:47.830 --> 39:49.600
Help me analyze it.

39:50.990 --> 39:52.420
You are

39:52.500 --> 39:54.110
still so annoying.

39:54.120 --> 39:55.570
You live up to your name.

39:55.910 --> 39:57.110
Just ask.

39:58.400 --> 40:00.470
The Baize Token has been missing for so long.

40:00.470 --> 40:02.670
I didn't expect it to be divided into two

40:03.020 --> 40:05.500
and left in Wen Xiao and me.

40:06.140 --> 40:07.400
But why couldn't I feel

40:07.880 --> 40:10.450
the Baize Token at all before?

40:10.990 --> 40:12.870
Since the Original Goddess,

40:13.800 --> 40:15.370
for the sake of fairness,

40:15.840 --> 40:18.260
the Baize Token has been divided into two,

40:18.510 --> 40:21.270
kept by a person and a demon.

40:21.880 --> 40:23.360
Only when the two keepers

40:23.650 --> 40:25.070
share a telepathic connection

40:25.070 --> 40:26.800
and fall in love with each other

40:26.920 --> 40:29.570
can they activate and use the power.

40:39.980 --> 40:41.670
This is too sudden.

40:47.070 --> 40:47.910
Since

40:47.940 --> 40:49.940
Goddess has regained her power,

40:49.960 --> 40:51.800
I guess you two already

40:51.950 --> 40:52.990
trust each other

40:53.690 --> 40:55.690
and share a telepathic connection.

40:59.190 --> 41:01.320
Zhao Yuanzhou, you're so despicable.

41:01.330 --> 41:03.150
Brother Zhuo and Wen

41:03.170 --> 41:04.510
are childhood sweethearts.

41:04.510 --> 41:05.510
How could you

41:05.510 --> 41:06.310
do this?

41:06.350 --> 41:08.050
So what if they've fallen in love with each other?

41:08.050 --> 41:09.670
Brotherhood is also love.

41:09.700 --> 41:11.220
Friendship is also love.

41:11.480 --> 41:13.680
We went through hardships along the way

41:13.710 --> 41:14.750
and shared weal and woe.

41:14.750 --> 41:16.150
We can say we share a telepathic connection.

41:16.150 --> 41:17.180
No need to mind it.

41:17.850 --> 41:18.570
-Yes.
-Yes.

41:18.930 --> 41:20.480
Mr. Zhuo, you are

41:20.640 --> 41:21.650
prudent.

41:22.660 --> 41:24.060
Stop talking about this.

41:24.390 --> 41:25.920
Let's hurry up

41:25.940 --> 41:27.510
and activate the formation.

41:27.510 --> 41:29.230
But the spiritual energy of Mount Kunlun

41:29.230 --> 41:30.790
has weakened long ago.

41:31.670 --> 41:34.620
The Star Formation requires a lot of spiritual energy.

41:34.620 --> 41:36.070
We'd better activate it

41:36.670 --> 41:38.630
at noon, when the spiritual energy

41:38.630 --> 41:39.630
is the strongest.

41:42.410 --> 41:43.970
Let's wait till tomorrow.

41:49.870 --> 41:51.950
Stall them in Sinan Water Town.

41:52.430 --> 41:53.780
Can you do it?

41:53.810 --> 41:55.410
How long should I stall them?

41:55.750 --> 41:56.630
It has to be

41:57.040 --> 41:58.120
just the right time.
